an4.57:1.3 starts: Then the Koliyan daughter Suppavāsā, with her own hand
an4.62:3.3 starts: When he thinks, ‘I have acquired wealth by energetic
an4.62:5.3 starts: When he thinks, ‘I have no debts to anyone
an4.37:5.5 starts: After rising, in the last watch of the night
an4.6:1.11 starts: a person is one of little learning who is not intent on what he has learned.
an4.6:2.5 starts: a person is one of little learning who is intent on what he has learned.
an4.6:3.5 starts: a person is one of much learning who is not intent on what he has learned.
an4.6:4.5 starts: a person is one of much learning who is intent on what he has learned.
